<title>USA: ESS to buy Platform Technologies.</title>
<headline>ESS to buy Platform Technologies.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>ESS Technology Inc said it agreed to buy privately-held Platform Technologies, Inc., a developer of multimedia subsystems for 2.2 million shares of ESS common stock.</p>
<p>The acquisition will be accounted for as a pooling of interests transaction and is expected to be completed by June 30, 1997.</p>
